# Information about `lha_reader_check`

## Function Signature

```c

int lha_reader_check(LHAReader *reader,
                     LHADecoderProgressCallback callback,
                     void *callback_data);
```

## Source Code

```c
int lha_reader_check(LHAReader *reader,
                     LHADecoderProgressCallback callback,
                     void *callback_data) {
  if (reader->curr_file_type != CURR_FILE_NORMAL) {
    return 0;
  }

  // CRC checking of directories is not necessary.

  if (!strcmp(reader->curr_file->compress_method,
              LHA_COMPRESS_TYPE_DIR)) {
    return 1;
  }

  // Decode file.

  return open_decoder(reader, callback, callback_data) && do_decode(reader, NULL);
}
```

